OL,3,GNEWSACouncil to enter lease agreement
OL,4,Afor school site
OL,5,
OL,6,FNottingham City Council is planning on
OL,7,Fentering into a lease agreement for a
OL,8,Fschool that never opened, as part of
OL,9,Fplans to redevelop the site into a
OL,10,Fspecial school.
OL,12,FThe 210-place Waterside Primary School
OL,13,Fwas due to open in the Trent Basin
OL,14,Festate in Nottingham in September 2024,
OL,15,Fbut the Department for Education (DfE)
OL,16,Fwithdrew funding due to low pupil
OL,17,Fdemand.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
