OL,3,GNEWSACouncil to enter lease agreement
OL,4,Afor school site
OL,5,
OL,6,FLast year, the authority announced it
OL,7,Fwould be redeveloped into a special
OL,8,Fschool, which the Local Democracy
OL,9,FReporting Service said was estimated to
OL,10,Fcost #6m.
OL,12,FCouncil documents now show the
OL,13,Fauthority is planning on entering into
OL,14,Fa 125-year lease for the school site
OL,15,Ffrom the DfE in order to expand
OL,16,FRosehill School's specialist SEND
OL,17,Fprovision.
